BLACK SOULS II VR is a fan-made VR mod. You may:
- download it from this repository and use it to play your own copy of BLACK SOULS II;
- record, stream and publish videos of play, monetized ones included;
- modify it and distribute modified versions free of charge, provided that you credit the original
  (https://github.com/Lobewarms/BLACKSOULS2_VR-release) and state clearly that your version is
  modified and not the original.

You may not:
- sell it or any modified version, or distribute either for any payment;
- distribute it, or a modified version, together with any of the original game's files.

To share the unmodified mod, please share a link to this repository rather than the files.

Third-party components inside the package keep their own licenses: three.js and the WebXR hand
models in app/vendor (MIT - their license files are included there).

BLACK SOULS II and its assets belong to their rights holders. None of the game's files are part of
this package or this repository, and nothing here grants any right to them.
